    heading: "method-29",
    content: "Lock expiration time in seconds. Range: \\[10, 300]. If the user holding the lock goes offline and returns to the channel within the TTL, they can still use the lock. Otherwise, the lock is released and users listening for `lock` events receive a `lockReleased` event."
